" >Lots of secrets I put a lot of secrets I think good luck!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handful of characters!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creacher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uhhh mini games?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(background) animals that rhyme with bat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(background) animals that dont rhyme with bat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*(you can go <strong>real</strong> fast)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044100/extras/bb3e5c8f97c8576d7bbe30585e9f4ab6.poster.avif?t=1736893847\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044100/extras/bb3e5c8f97c8576d7bbe30585e9f4ab6.webm?t=1736893847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044100/extras/bb3e5c8f97c8576d7bbe30585e9f4ab6.mp4?t=1736893847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>use brain!! warning brain use may be required</i></p>",
